# Deny by default: only what the image runs is sent to the build.
*

!pyproject.toml
!requirements.lock
!README.md
!LICENSE
!src/**
!configs/**
!calendars/**
!docker/**
# Read at runtime: the Narrator system prompt (fse.notify.narrator) and the
# rules table `fse drafts build` reads by default.
!prompts/narrator.md
!docs/rules_table.md
# Plugins and the modules they import: add one `!research/<name>/**` line per plugin.
!research/__init__.py
# Never in the image, even inside an allowed folder.
research/**/tests/
research/**/.agents/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*
infra/
.venv/
.agents/
